<title>RUSSIA: Russian Almazjuvelir confirms PGM supplies renewed.</title>
<headline>Russian Almazjuvelir confirms PGM supplies renewed.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian precious metals export agency Almazjuvelirexport confirmed on Tuesday it had resumed long-delayed deliveries of platinum group metals to Japan, saying the first supplies left Russia on July 8.</p>
<p>&quot;Deliveries were renewed on July 8, which is a little bit earlier than the July 10 we had discussed,&quot; Sergei Gorny, a deputy director at the agency, said. Almazjuvelirexport had said earlier that supplies would resume around July 10.</p>
</text>
